PREAMBLE

The Express MakeGamer License (hereinafter — "EMGL" or "the License")
is a permissive open license created for games, articles, documentation,
and source code. It is designed to grant maximum freedom to developers,
authors, and creators, while preserving one fundamental principle: the
protection of human creativity and authorship from unauthorized use in
the training of artificial intelligence systems, neural networks, and
machine learning models.

This License is inspired by the spirit of permissive open-source licenses
such as the MIT License, while introducing a single, clearly defined
restriction that reflects the values of its author and the community
that supports it.

