3. RESTRICTIONS

3.1. The Work, in whole or in part, shall not be used for the Training
     of any Neural Network, artificial intelligence system, machine
     learning model, or similar technology, without the explicit prior
     written permission of the Author.

3.2. This restriction applies to, but is not limited to:
     (a) training new models on the Work;
     (b) fine-tuning existing models on the Work;
     (c) using the Work as part of a dataset for model training;
     (d) using the Work to generate synthetic training data;
     (e) any other form of machine learning or AI training that
         incorporates the Work.

3.3. This restriction does not apply to:
     (a) the use of Neural Networks as tools for creating Derivative
         Works, provided that the Work itself is not used for Training;
     (b) academic research, provided that the Work is not used for
         Training of Neural Networks.

3.4. Any violation of this section terminates the rights granted under
     this License automatically and immediately.

